  shopHotkey: '[{0}]'
  howToTitle: HOW TO PLAY
  howToBodyLeft: "<color=#73D9FF><b>DEFEND THE CORE</b></color>\n\n    Enemies march on the core in waves. Click them before they reach it. Survive as many waves as you can.\n\n\n    <color=#FFC94C><b>AMMO</b></color>\n\n    Your clip holds <b>6 shots</b> (+3 per <i>Extended Clip</i> perk). Empty clips reload by themselves; <b>R</b> / <b>RMB</b> reloads early. Enemies sometimes drop <b>gold ammo charges</b> that fly to the core and refill the clip instantly, more often when you're low.\n\n\n    <color=#C780FF><b>SOULS & ORBS</b></color>\n\n    Kills give souls. Shoot the orbs they drop: purple = souls, green = a shield charge."
  howToBodyRight: "<color=#73D9FF><b>THE WEAPON RING</b></color>\n\n    The ring around the core is cut into <b>slots</b>. Every shot goes through the slot your aim crosses, and that slot decides <b>what</b> you fire.\n\n\n    - Plain slots fire your <b>basic shot</b>.\n\n    - Each <b>technique</b> you buy adds one <b>special slot</b> (glowing, with an icon). It fires once, then empties and <b>reloads a random technique you own</b>.\n\n    - Every wave the ring <b>re-rolls</b>: a new random slot count (5 to 12, never fewer than your techniques) and a new layout. That's why the number of slots changes.\n\n    - The ring slowly turns, so aim where the special slot is.\n\n\n    <color=#C780FF><b>SHOP</b></color>\n\n    Between waves spend souls on buffs and techniques. Some techniques combine into <b>synergies</b>."
  howToControls: <b>LMB</b> shoot     <b>R / RMB</b> reload     <b>SPACE</b> nova     <b>Q</b> overdrive     <b>1-5</b> buy in shop     <b>ESC</b> pause
  howToBack: BACK
